x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/114.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 OPR/89.0.4447.51', 'WebKit', 'Opera', 'Windows', 'United States', 'Phoenix', 'Arizona', 0, '2026-02-04 02:16:17', '2026-02-04 02:16:17'),
