(95, 'Luciana Pulley', 'luciana.pulley@yahoo.com', '889776565', 'hello?', 'Resurrect your old customer list\r\n\r\nYour database of old customers sitting in your database is a gold mine. We use those \"dead\" emails and broadcast your business directly to that exact list on the big screen.\r\n\r\nOur system automatically filters out low-income areas, making sure your budget only targets homeowners who can actually pay. \r\n\r\nIt’s a simple flat rate with zero management fees. 100% of your spend goes directly toward your inventory to your target customers.\r\n\r\nCheck your area here:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.topshelfpromotion.com', '91.233.0.111', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', 'WebKit', 'Chrome', 'Windows', 'United States', 'Charleston', 'West Virginia', 0, '2026-05-10 13:29:53', '2026-05-10 13:29:53'),
